{"user":"DSHaidCF8JuKb5QF","title":"healthcheckup","type":"LAB_REPORT","providerName":"HOSPITAL","tags":[],"fileUrl":"/uploads/1779385523673-166839606-cv.pdf","fileHash":"9f7b00d9a7142b4d1e8e1e4c14827236daa613779efb97edc0acd531267e584d","extractedText":"PROJECTS\nSUMMARY\nNews Aggregation Platform\nDeveloped a responsive news application using React and REST APIs for real-time news updates.\nImplemented  category-based  filtering,  search  functionality,  and  personalized  bookmarking\nfeatures.\nOptimized frontend performance with reusable components and efficient API handling.\nHealthtrack- Emergency Health Data System\nBuilt  a  full-stack  emergency  health  data  system  enabling  fast  and  secure  access  to  patient\nrecords\nImplemented role-based authentication to ensure data privacy and controlled access\nOptimized backend and database operations for low-latency data retrieval in critical scenarios\nSRAJAN TEWARI\ntewarisrajan@gmail.com | 7081633397 | Lucknow, India \nSoftware  Engineering  student  with  a  curiosity  for  solving  real  problems  and  building  useful  applications.\nAdaptable, consistent, and a strong team player, looking for an opportunity to learn, build, and contribute.\nEDUCATION\nExpected 2026Kamla Nehru Institute of Technology\nBachelor of Technology, Computer Science and Engineering (CGPA of 7.81)\nLanguages    Python, C++, SQL\nWeb                HTML, JavaScript, React, Node.js\nCore                Data Structures and Algorithms, DBMS, OOPS, Operating Systems\nTools               Git, Github\nEDUCATION\nKEY SKILLS\nhttps://github.com/tewarisrajan/healthtrack\nTechstack - HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Node.js, MySQL\nStudent Result Management System\nBuilt a database-driven system using Python to manage student records and streamline result\nprocessing\nDesigned and implemented efficient SQL queries for fast data retrieval and updates\nAutomated grade calculation and result generation, reducing manual effort and errors\nTechstack - Python, MySQL, JavaScript\nTechstack - React, JavaScript, Tailwind CSS, REST APIs\nSt. Don Bosco College, Lakhimpur Kheri\nClass 12 (Percentage - 92%)\nSt. Don Bosco College, Lakhimpur Kheri\nClass 10 (Percentage - 94%)\n2021\n2019\nEXTRA-CURRICULAR ACTIVITIES\nVice President, Innovation Incubation and Startup Foundation — led initiatives and coordinated events\nCaptain, College Basketball Team — led team coordination and strategy in competitive events\nEvent Head, Google Developer Groups — organized technical events","blockchainVerified":false,"createdAt":{"$$date":1779385524108},"_id":"r3FOuLTvVyvR5X2E"}
